{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n本地精品咖啡!必食焦糖香蕉法式多士\n</p>\n<h2>Brentwood Coffee Roaster觀塘開分店</h2>\n<p>本地精品咖啡品牌 Brentwood Coffee Roaster 以自家烘焙精品咖啡及高水準西餐打響名堂，最近小編即將進駐觀塘 apm 開設分店，大家不用過海都食到了！餐廳多款全日早餐、意粉及烘焙甜品口碑極佳，最出名就是焦糖香蕉法式多士，選用牛油香氣濃郁的厚身 Brioche 浸滿蛋漿後煎焗，金黃微焦內裡則保留了濕潤蛋香與近似布甸的微彈口感，加上薄脆焦糖外殼的香蕉面層，咬下去有「咔滋」的脆感，是店內名物之一！</p>\n<h2>自家烘焙咖啡特飲！</h2>\n<p>店家擁有自家烘焙線，提供穩定且香氣濃郁的配方豆（如 Maytime、Awake），並定期更換來自埃塞俄比亞、哥倫比亞等地的單品手沖豆（如厭氧發酵或水洗處理豆）。融合新派特調概念，將冷萃咖啡與水果、茶飲結合，例如用澄清橙汁、奶油伯爵茶配冷萃的 Tropical Sunset，以及玫瑰糖漿氣泡特調 Rosé Tonique，清新果香與氣泡感適合配搭濃郁的卡邦尼意粉。</p>\n<p>Brentwood Coffee Roaster<br/>\n地址：觀塘觀塘道418號創紀之城五期(apm)大堂高層15號舖<br/>\n官方IG：@brentwoodcoffeeroaster</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541121132219604_16988512906b03cd0ba9a5a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541121132219604_16988512906b03cd0ba9a5a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541121303368841_20738675396b03cd0d7d079.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541121303368841_20738675396b03cd0d7d079.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541121500310016_14405376246b03cd0f7b0eb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541121500310016_14405376246b03cd0f7b0eb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541121669189558_2939953736b03cd114cf00.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541121669189558_2939953736b03cd114cf00.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541121893680737_18645049086b03cd1360771.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541121893680737_18645049086b03cd1360771.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954112206952072_9372082526b03cd155a3aa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954112206952072_9372082526b03cd155a3aa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541122310292532_16822827146b03cd1777587.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541122310292532_16822827146b03cd1777587.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgElFUqgjYd/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:30:22.798526+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":677,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T05:20:24+00:00","fetched_at":"202